    "SHA256/SHA256d semantics never change",
    "share target/verifier/header truth never changes",
    "prediction never overwrites observation",
    "stale data is not current data",
    "old SHA-home cognitive curriculum remains retired",
    "Theta is evaluated inside M2R against real future holdout"
  ],
  "acceptance_tests": [
    "For every brightness index, display and enabled LED receive the same canonical brightness value",
    "With L off, LED output remains zero while [ ] still change display and stored shared index",
    "With L re-enabled, LED immediately returns at the current shared brightness step",
    "Anomaly white and House amber change colour/state only; they do not bypass the shared brightness axis",
    "Brightness index and LED-enabled state survive reboot through final ADV_Elite persistence layer",
    "No game-only variable is emitted as OBSERVED_REAL"
  ],
  "status": "TRANSPLANT_POLICY_FROZEN_FOR_FINAL_ADV_ELITE_COMPOSITION"
